---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy - Rehman Veterinary Clinic Lahore</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for Rehman Veterinary Clinic, your trusted 24 hour animal hospital lahore and mobile home visit vet lahore." />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans selection:bg-emerald-200 selection:text-emerald-900">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">At <strong>Rehman Veterinary Clinic Lahore</strong>, we are committed to protecting your privacy. When you book a <strong>home visit vet lahore</strong> or consult our <strong>24 hour animal hospital lahore</strong>, we collect basic information such as your name, phone number, address, and pet details. This helps our <strong>emergency vet lahore</strong> provide immediate care.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We use your information solely to provide veterinary services, including appointments for our mobile <strong>pet vaccination center</strong> and routine check-ups. We do not sell your personal data to third parties. If you are searching for a "<strong>vet near me</strong>", we use your location data strictly to dispatch Dr. Saif to your doorstep efficiently.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Communication</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">By providing your phone number, you agree to receive SMS or WhatsApp messages related to your pet's appointment, lab results, or emergency care instructions.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Security</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We implement standard security measures to protect your data. However, no digital transmission is 100% secure.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at info@rehmanvetclinic.com or call +92 311 4899904.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
